# .env.kdf.example, the credentials kriegerdataforge-cicd needs for local work (env standard, ADR D-030)
#
# Copy this file to .env.kdf and fill in each value. .env.kdf holds every credential that works beyond this machine.
# git ignores it and every AI session is refused it, so a person fills it in and no model reads it. Never commit it,
# and never paste a value from it anywhere. Values that work only on this machine go in .env.local, see
# .env.local.example.

# A fine grained GitHub token, Contents read only, on Needless2Say/kriegerdataforge-fmt, never a classic token. It
# starts with github_pat_. make setup and make style install the private kdf-fmt formatter with it. Left empty, git
# uses its own credentials.
GH_PACKAGES_PAT=
